  "articleBody": "To plan a home office remodel, define your work requirements, inspect the existing room, establish a layout, plan electrical and lighting needs, select materials, confirm the approval path, and compare detailed proposals before construction begins. A coordinated design-build process can connect these decisions so the finished room supports daily work rather than merely adding a desk and paint.",
